WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.784 --> 00:00:09.065
A venue manager can only see and select the staff you assign to them. This tutorial

2
00:00:09.065 --> 00:00:13.832
shows how to assign a team, using fictional demonstration data.

3
00:00:14.294 --> 00:00:18.598
Open Users, then select the Venue managers tab.

4
00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:23.165
Select View on a venue manager to open their details.

5
00:00:23.626 --> 00:00:28.555
Open the More menu beside the tabs, and choose Assigned staff.

6
00:00:29.021 --> 00:00:34.275
This list is everyone the venue manager can currently see and select in their app.

7
00:00:34.737 --> 00:00:40.911
Select Add Staff. The Select Staff page lists the staff in your workspace, and

8
00:00:40.911 --> 00:00:44.315
anyone already assigned is marked Assigned.

9
00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:49.039
Tick the people you want to add, then select Confirm.

10
00:00:49.505 --> 00:00:55.572
They now appear in the assigned list. To remove someone, select the cross beside

11
00:00:55.572 --> 00:01:00.957
their name and confirm. Their account and work history are not deleted.
